{
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - .",
    "Reason : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 14/08/2024. The use of the outbuilding as a self-contained dwelling at 15 Annexe Rear of, Norman Crescent, TW5 9LR was lawful within the meaning of Section 191 and 192 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended) for the following reason:\r\n\r\nThe application in respect of the use of the existing outbuilding as a self-contained dwelling at 15 Annexe Rear of, Norman Crescent, TW5 9LR would comply with Section 191 of the Town and Country Planning Act (as amended) and the use would be lawful. The evidence supplied establishes that on the balance of probabilities the extension has been in place for an uninterrupted period of at least four years.\r\n"
  ],
